From 3176c9930508dac813a7ab8bc38739b0cb47297e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: slwyts <slwyts@foxmail.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 14:11:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] power: supply: piano_mca: authenticate Xiaomi chargers before
 PPS

Complete MiPPS challenge/response in the charger workqueue. Recover
omitted adapter identities only after validating a fresh challenge,
preserve USB data roles, and use the stock Piano command order so
authenticated adapters expose their PPS capabilities.

Keep existing charge-current and thermal limits, with ordinary PD/PPS
fallback on failure. Invalidate authentication when the ADSP restarts
or a source is unplugged, including short replug intervals.

Signed-off-by: slwyts <slwyts@foxmail.com>
